{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_01_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_01","title":"金盞花","storyCode":"NL-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"84ca31983f6fe107ce66a201002ea88eaaf1e72bf473481d71fe13a4596b33d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"馬克維茨從麥基口中聽到了“零號地塊”的事情，大為動容，同時，在一場即將開始的比賽中，鏽銅騎士似乎對感染者對手別有用心。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 1-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留步，馬克維茨先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是您啊，麥基先生，您......您有事找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了，你收到聯合會的信件了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特錦賽期間負責賽事監督的發言人只有我們倆......這可是個苦差事，但也備受矚目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想要在摘掉“發言人”三個字之後還能繼續平步青雲，眼下這可是最好的機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......不怕您笑話，我寧可不被這麼矚目，去負責場地活動的策劃一類......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您擅長這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可沒什麼擅長不擅長的，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又謙虛了，您適應得比那些老員工都快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過今天找您，是有一些別的事情我想提前知會您一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們找一間休息室聊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，聽您的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事需要這麼謹慎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實這些，本不該我來和您說，但是恰爾內先生走得匆忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡瓦萊利亞基除了核心的大騎士領本土，每屆會從商業發展最迅速的城市中選出三座，合併成為如今的大騎士領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在特錦賽結束之後的幾個月內，除了大騎士領外的移動城市，會根據航線工程師的設計，在一個月內回到原本的航線之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次四城合併都是一次機遇。可觀的人流量，無縫通商，以及......處理一些問題的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，要不是四城聯合的規模實在過於龐大，無法有效移動，躲避天災，也難處理物資分配和開採問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真希望四城聯合永不解散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過今天要說的是一個......嗯......潛規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是關於......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅什科工業集團今年為大騎士領提供了七個移動平台，相當於其他國家一座城區的規模......當然，這是檯面上的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些，我都從同事那裡聽聞過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們應當關注的重點是零號地塊。它不在梅什科工業交付的合法名單上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個地塊性質特殊，它是一個規模很小的移動平台，現在連接在西南邊角，十七號城區之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，那裡就在感染者收容治療中心旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我的無禮，馬克維茨先生，接下來我們交談的每一句話，都要錄影記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是規定......發言人之中不允許有任何背叛聯合會的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的臉色很難看......我知道，我一開始聽說的時候，也是您這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這也太不人道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您現在是董事會的執行人，商業聯合會的發言人，馬克維茨兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是提醒您這一點，當然，不是警告或是威脅什麼的——哈哈，恰爾內先生總會給人這樣的感覺對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡在把握，瞭若指掌。你不聽他的可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒那個意思，馬克維茨兄，我們得相互扶持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您該好好想想我的話，我接下來還要去和幾個騎士團確認行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪恩納？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在嗎？瑪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......佐菲婭姑母？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......瑪嘉烈，你怎麼還在家裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭那孩子不是說你去騎士協會了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"一些程序上的瑣事罷了，花不了多少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵，你真的變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為那個叫“羅德島”的地方？你以前可根本不擅長那些文書工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得你剛報名成為騎士的時候嗎？獨立騎士瑪嘉烈·臨光，總是把各種證件和手續搞混......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那時候多虧了有你，姑母。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......瑪莉婭那丫頭也就算了，你年紀不是和我差不多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前花了那麼大力氣讓你習慣直呼其名，怎麼幾年沒見，又變回去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們生疏了？嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵，沒有的事，佐菲婭。我只是很久沒和家人這樣面對面交流了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來探望叔叔的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......他還在工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪恩納他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會敵視他，也不會埋怨他的，佐菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......比賽就要開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是老樣子，人多得誇張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那個鋒盔騎士團的傢伙，去年是不是也見過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，別管那種傢伙，就連左手騎士都是瑪莉婭的手下敗將啦，鋒盔騎士團算什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......只是偶然，偶然而已，總是這麼說怪讓人不好意思的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。今晚的比賽，似乎也有“鏽銅”奧爾默·英格拉參與......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，都是熟人啊，瑪莉婭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"——你少說兩句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的啦，科瓦爾師傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經放棄成為競技騎士的想法了，那實在不適合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"就是！成為自己的方式有那麼多，沒必要被迫做什麼選擇！這是老年人的忠告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，你的表現已經很亮眼啦，敬你一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，瑪嘉烈的那身盔甲是不是還沒有做最終調試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"她之前穿的那一身雖然做工是不錯，但怎麼看也不適合瑪嘉烈這樣勇猛的庫蘭塔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我已經在著手調整了，還需要點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"還有姐姐的武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪嘉烈剛參加騎士競技時，用的是一把戰錘。再後來，她改用一把騎士長劍，光芒在她的劍刃上縈繞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"現在——是一柄劍槍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！米諾斯的D32夾鋼鍛造工藝，極佳的源石技藝傳導性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"真懷念啊，那時候瑪嘉烈來找我給她換一把趁手的劍——那可是臨光老爺的孫女第一次開口讓我幫忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"別懷舊了，科瓦爾，耀騎士下周就要登場了，你們到底有沒有在幫她！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊？你以為我是你嗎？整天只知道喝酒，遊手好閒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"（鏽銅騎士參加的是......奪旗賽......？為什麼沸血騎士團會浪費一個精英騎士參加這種吃力不討好的賽制......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"（鏽銅的對手是......唔，都是些小有名氣的騎士團......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"（......慢著，有感染者騎士......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特錦賽正賽，嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在成為感染者的時候，你想過會有這麼一天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想過能站在這個賽場上，為自己贏取那感覺幾輩子都賺不到的財富嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"加入紅松騎士團是我的榮幸，野鬃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，喊我名字就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"好！等我拿到獎金，請你喝酒，艾沃娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，除了灰毫根本沒人陪我喝酒，我正無聊得很——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——奪旗戰的規則還記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"記得，儘量待在得分線裡，儘量避免直接衝突——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那是索娜教你的那套——要我說，打爛那群貴族騎士的盔甲，你就是冠軍啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人搶分，你就先把人解決了，不是很簡單嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈哈哈......如果我能做到的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自信點。不好好鬧上一場，他們是不會看得起你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想讓別人仰視你，很簡單，把他們揍趴下，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過好像有人是衝你來的，哈，那傢伙還沒在灰毫那邊吃夠苦頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"奧爾默·英格拉......他是為了報復感染者才來到這裡的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"真是心胸狹隘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族子弟，啐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來灰毫那一仗挫敗他的自尊心了，虛有其表的傢伙根本不該站在賽場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——手癢。不然找個機會私下把他揍一頓得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在——有請各騎士入場——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們還在等我們回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎哈。紅松騎士團......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，一群禍害......也敢自稱騎士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏽銅騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......該死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["瑪嘉烈"]}]}
